title: Budget in Crisis
subtitle: An urgent card: the cabinet proposes how to cover the money the state lacks, and the Sejm votes on it.
is-card: true
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && PolishProjects.budgetCardAvailable(Q) !}
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
// Card parliament.finance_amendment (technical reference 17.10; card catalogue 7.3): open while a package of this cabinet waits
// for its vote and PPS is in the cabinet or supports it (decision 5 of stage 4); an urgent card of the Parliament deck until the
// vote (Z — 0.74, decision 3A of 8 X 2026). Z — 1.11 (decision 6A of 8 XI 2026): “Budget in Crisis” — the cabinet's solution and
// its effects in plain words, and four answers for 0 T: support, vote against, abstain, not now; the conditions of PPS left the card.
PolishProjects.budgetCrisisView(Q);
!}

= Budget in crisis

[+ pl_bud_intro +]

[? if pl_bud_necessary : [+ pl_bud_necessary_text +] ?]

- @support
- @refuse
- @abstain
- @later

@support
title: Support
subtitle: [+ pl_bud_support_line +]
on-arrival: {!
Q.pl_bud_result = PolishProjects.budgetAnswerText(Q, 'support');
!}
go-to: result

@refuse
title: Vote against
subtitle: [+ pl_bud_refuse_line +]
on-arrival: {!
Q.pl_bud_result = PolishProjects.budgetAnswerText(Q, 'refuse');
!}
go-to: result

@abstain
title: Abstain
subtitle: [+ pl_bud_abstain_line +]
on-arrival: {!
Q.pl_bud_result = PolishProjects.budgetAnswerText(Q, 'abstain');
!}
go-to: result

@later
title: Not now
subtitle: Without an answer PPS votes as its role binds it; the card stays in the hand until the vote.
go-to: root

@result
new-page: true

= Budget in crisis

[+ pl_bud_result +]

- @root: Continue.
